#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:5 4c592c40364c4374b3c23c6cf7e1c7eb
msgid "ArduPilot Python Style Guide"
msgstr "ArduPilot Python 风格指南"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:7 030bb55696ad48a49fd47bcd2fab9988
msgid ""
"In order to improve the readability of the ArduPilot code, and help new "
"users pick up the code more quickly, please use the following styles. Code "
"submitted may be rejected if these styles are not followed."
msgstr "为提高 ArduPilot 代码的可读性，并帮助新用户更快上手，请遵循以下代码风格。不符合这些风格的代码提交可能被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:12
#: 88f705c73c8a475da3722e9f621d5459
msgid ""
"Some parts of the code may not conform due to historic reasons but new "
"additions should!"
msgstr "部分历史代码可能不符合规范，但新增代码必须遵守！"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:16
#: 91ab72cd759d418c968329861aebe5d1
msgid "Supported Python Versions"
msgstr "支持的 Python 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:18
#: 1d44ebb0e8234fa6811d7fb5e15e1835
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports Python versions back to 3.9 - scripts should be written "
"with an eye to working back that far."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持的 Python 版本可追溯到 3.9——编写脚本时应注意兼容到该版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:21
#: 425e619c62064fef82044752f97f46a0
msgid "Method Names"
msgstr "方法命名"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:23
#: d1d1c801fe0c4c1285b2a9ccb7e2b5de
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's Python has not traditionally used ``_`` as a hint that a member "
"is intended for internal use."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的 Python 代码传统上并未使用 ``_`` 来提示某成员仅供内部使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:25
#: a832203cc392499793817ef2b1b6827b
msgid "They should be omitted until we adopt the convention."
msgstr "在我们采用该约定之前，应省略它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:28
#: 8f65cf34cfdf48569eb6682549f4fb02
msgid "Type Annotations"
msgstr "类型注解"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:30
#: 96a5a7e5632846f09ee360a2653c9ec0
msgid "New functions should have type annotations."
msgstr "新函数应带有类型注解。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:32
#: ac1a078137c74866bb67786c162f5088
msgid ""
"If you are modifying a function's signature please consider adding type "
"annotations."
msgstr "如果你在修改函数的签名，请考虑添加类型注解。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:34
#: efd824546c3243ff98973e5578bdf174
msgid "**Right:**"
msgstr "**正确：**"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:45
#: 29c9e109a6f54775bb370004df6a4618
msgid "Automated Linting"
msgstr "自动化代码检查（Lint）"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:47
#: 0b0d521dc0ff406687999b7fa56b0842
msgid "Generally ``ruff`` is used to lint the codebase."
msgstr "代码库一般使用 ``ruff`` 进行 lint 检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/python-style-guide.rst:49
#: e028fea8de9f4376a3c68a344013507d
msgid ""
"It is often triggered via ``pre-commit``.  You can use ``pre-commit run "
"--all-files`` to validate your changes are correct. This check is enforced "
"on CI."
msgstr ""
"它通常通过 ``pre-commit`` 触发。你可以使用 ``pre-commit run --all-files`` 来验证你的更改是否正确。CI "
"会强制执行此检查。"
